    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this captivating 2D pixel art retro platformer and enter a world where speed and precision determine your success. With a total of 60 levels spread across 4 diverse worlds, you'll experience fast-paced single-screen action: collect all the gold coins, master treacherous traps, and overcome dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Challenging Levels:</strong> Each world features 20 unique levels that will test your speedrunner spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art:</strong> A lovingly crafted aesthetic that reinterprets classic platformer action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise Platforming:</strong> React in a flash to traps and obstacles in single-screen level designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Earn achievements and prove your skills in exciting challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Final Boss:</strong> Confront the ultimate enemy in a battle that decides the fate of a family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure full of heart, action, and nostalgia\u2014and let yourself be captivated by <strong>Little Betty: Gold Rush</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this captivating 2D pixel art retro platformer and enter a world where speed and precision determine your success. With a total of 60 levels spread across 4 diverse worlds, you'll experience fast-paced single-screen action: collect all the gold coins, master treacherous traps, and overcome dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Challenging Levels:</strong> Each world features 20 unique levels that will test your speedrunner spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art:</strong> A lovingly crafted aesthetic that reinterprets classic platformer action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise Platforming:</strong> React in a flash to traps and obstacles in single-screen level designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Earn achievements and prove your skills in exciting challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Final Boss:</strong> Confront the ultimate enemy in a battle that decides the fate of a family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure full of heart, action, and nostalgia\u2014and let yourself be captivated by <strong>Little Betty: Gold Rush</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "Help brave Betty to collect the stolen gold! In this fast-paced 2D pixel art retro single screen platformer, you'll race through 60 challenging levels full of traps, obstacles and surprises.",
